{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":9},"5 hectares","Qu’est-ce qui conduit un homme établi à mettre en péril son confort, sa carrière et son couple ? La passion, d’autant plus brûlante qu’elle est tardive, pour cinq hectares de terre limousine. Mais la terre se mérite, surtout quand on vient de la ville. Voilà Franck précipité dans la quête du Graal. Il lui faut un tracteur. (Franck jeopardizes his comfort, his career and his relationship. His passion: 5 hectares of land in the Limousin region, for which he needs a tractor.)",[4,5,6,7,8],"high rank employment","marriage","rural","independent home","new start",{"type":10,"id":11,"slug":12,"title":13,"release":15,"filmType":19,"directors":20,"genre":22,"media":24,"synopsis":27,"production":30,"characters":34,"roles":60,"awards":101,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_229","fr2023-229-5-hectares",{"native":1,"english":14},"",{"type":16,"date":17,"year":18},"Theatrical release","2023-12-27",2023,"Fiction film",[21],"Emilie Deleuze",[23],"Comedy",{"posterUrl":25,"trailerUrl":26},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/137/31/270217/format_page/5-hectares.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fD5fjSiFwno",{"native":28,"english":29},"Qu’est-ce qui conduit un homme établi à mettre en péril son confort, sa carrière et son couple ? La passion, d’autant plus brûlante qu’elle est tardive, pour cinq hectares de terre limousine. Mais la terre se mérite, surtout quand on vient de la ville. Voilà Franck précipité dans la quête du Graal. Il lui faut un tracteur.","Franck jeopardizes his comfort, his career and his relationship. His passion: 5 hectares of land in the Limousin region, for which he needs a tractor.",[31],{"country":32,"share":33},"France","Majority coproducer",[35],{"id":36,"film":11,"person":37,"age":53,"gender":42,"sexuality":54,"origin":55,"class":56,"profession":57,"ability":58,"assistedMobility":59},"FR2023_229_01",{"id":38,"slug":39,"name":38,"birthYear":40,"deathYear":41,